CM_ "DRAFT can2gauge DBC: MaxxECU Default CAN protocol 1.2 + 1.3 (base 0x520, movable with 'DefaultCANProtocol ID Offset', fw 1.149+). Written from the published webhelp layout; MaxxECU's own DBC (TT-Speed, no licence stated) was only read for cross-checking. All values int16 per the webhelp.";
CM_ BO_ 1312 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ SG_ 1312 MAP "Absolute kPa (gauge 'map' is mbar: x10). Boost = MAP - baro (0x530) stays in code.";
CM_ BO_ 1313 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ BO_ 1314 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ BO_ 1315 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ BO_ 1316 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ SG_ 1316 FirmwareVersion "Webhelp scale 0.001; MaxxECU's own v1.3 DBC says 0.01 - UNVERIFIED which. Constant while running: useful fingerprint.";
CM_ BO_ 1317 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ BO_ 1318 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ SG_ 1318 KnockDetected "Held 250 ms after a knock (MaxxECU DBC comment).";
CM_ BO_ 1319 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ BO_ 1320 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ SG_ 1320 KnockCorrection "Sign convention (retard positive or negative) not stated - UNVERIFIED.";
CM_ BO_ 1328 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ SG_ 1328 Baro "Fingerprint: raw ~950-1050 at sea level.";
CM_ BO_ 1329 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ SG_ 1329 EthanolConcentration "Webhelp: outputs 85 % with no sensor or a sensor error. MaxxECU's own DBC comment says zero - UNVERIFIED which (firmware dependent?).";
CM_ SG_ 1329 EGT1 "All EGTs are sent even for unconfigured sensors.";
CM_ BO_ 1330 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ BO_ 1331 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ BO_ 1332 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2.";
CM_ BO_ 1333 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.2, fw 1.79+.";
CM_ BO_ 1334 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. Bytes 0-3 v1.2 (fw 1.79+), bytes 4-7 v1.3 (fw 1.135+; nothing sent there in 1.2).";
CM_ SG_ 1334 Gear "Encoding of reverse / neutral not documented - UNVERIFIED (0 assumed neutral).";
CM_ SG_ 1334 BoostSolenoidDuty "Webhelp table says v1.2; its changelog says 0x536 bytes 2-3 were spare in 1.2 - UNVERIFIED.";
CM_ SG_ 1334 OilPressure "kPa (gauge 'oilPressure' is bar: /100). Absolute or gauge not stated - UNVERIFIED.";
CM_ BO_ 1335 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ SG_ 1335 FuelPressure1 "kPa (gauge 'fuelPressure' is bar: /100). Absolute or gauge not stated - UNVERIFIED.";
CM_ BO_ 1336 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ BO_ 1337 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ BO_ 1344 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+. MaxxECU warns 0x540 collides with VAG DSG: use 1.2 (or move the offset) on DSG cars.";
CM_ BO_ 1345 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ BO_ 1346 "Source: maxxecu.com webhelp can-default_maxxecu_protocol. v1.3, fw 1.135+.";
CM_ SG_ 1346 EcuErrorCodes "uint16, fw 1.149+, rotates through stored codes, 0x0000 = none.";
